  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Land Management and Climate Friendly Agriculture (FSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve sustainability of agricultural and forestry land use management in pilot areas of Turkey. The project will promote the demonstration and adoption of low-carbon technologies with win-win benefits in terms of land degradation, mitigating climate change, and protecting biodiversity. The project will also contribute to increase sustainable farm profitability and forest productivity.</narrative>
  </description>
